@startuml
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #333333
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
hide empty description

title hotel.status
[*] --> DRAFT : partner adds a hotel
DRAFT --> PENDING_VERIFICATION : partner submits the first verification
PENDING_VERIFICATION --> ACTIVE : manager approves
PENDING_VERIFICATION --> DRAFT : manager rejects or asks for changes
ACTIVE -[dashed]-> SUSPENDED : manager suspends after a violation (planned)
SUSPENDED -[dashed]-> ACTIVE : suspension lifted (planned)
ACTIVE -[dashed]-> INACTIVE : partner stops selling (planned)
INACTIVE -[dashed]-> ACTIVE : partner reopens (planned)
legend bottom
An ACTIVE hotel stays ACTIVE while an update or re-verification request is reviewed.
Dashed arrow: planned, not implemented yet.
endlegend
@enduml